// generated by toolkit-builder/. Counts here must match the generated files
// (the builder prints them at the end of each run).
//
// Checkout links live outside the code, in the TOOLKIT_CHECKOUT_URLS env var:
// a JSON object keyed by slug, plus "bundle", e.g.
//   {"hipaa":"https://checkout.dodopayments.com/buy/pdt_...","bundle":"https://..."}
